# covers: 3 E4.2, 3 E4.6, 3 E6.7
# fixture: phase3-pvp
# Pending engine/client integration; declaration is not execution evidence.
# Timeouts: received-state delivery 10 ticks *100ms *3 =3s (A1).
# Login/RPC: existing runner allowance5s *3=15s; movement<=37.5tiles /3.75tiles/s *3<=30s.
# Speed input: professions/human_mystic.toml:22 (run120); domain/zone/phase2.rs:109-112 (375milli-tiles/tick).
# Fixture combat30s *3=90s; no damage calculation determines a wait.
# Pinned dp3ca488dd src/main/resources/data/stats/skills/01100-01199.xml:1645,1846:
# Wind Strike base hitTime4000ms *3=12s; Ice Bolt base3100ms *3 rounds up to12s.
# 01000-01099.xml:554,1553,1560: Resurrection6000ms *3=18s, Might1200s *3=3600s.
# A6: regen30ticks *100ms *3=9s; A16/R7: flag1200ticks *100ms *3=360s.
# Boundaries are checked against the estimated current tick (D132) and received deadlines; source waits are conservative budgets.
nf.Login
nf.WaitFor connected 15
nf.EnterWorld
nf.WaitFor in_world 15
nf.WaitFor own_sp >= 0 3
nf.WaitFor entity_in_view 01970000-0000-7000-8000-000000000031 30
nf.Target 01970000-0000-7000-8000-000000000031
# Formulas.java:665-743/263-486: starter melee competes with HP/CP regen.
# Use learned Wind Strike rank5 (power21, skills/01100-01199.xml) while attacking.
# Exact kill/CP/karma assertions remain; replay checks actual skill damage.
nf.Attack
nf.CastIf 1177 target_alive
nf.Sleep 5
nf.CastIf 1177 target_alive
nf.Sleep 5
nf.CastIf 1177 target_alive
nf.Sleep 5
nf.CastIf 1177 target_alive
nf.Sleep 5
# replay-gate: skill_damage_matches_oracle 1177
nf.WaitFor own_pk == 1 90
nf.StopAttack
nf.Expect own_karma > 0
nf.Expect own_pvp == 0
nf.Expect karma_gain_matches_oracle
# Formulas.java:1814-1821: level14 keltir XP truncates to zero karma loss.
# Dedicated HP1/rawXP1000 fixture preserves production keltir and exact formula.
nf.Target template:karma_reward
nf.WaitFor target != none 3
nf.Attack
nf.WaitFor sp_gained_total == 2 30
nf.StopAttack
nf.WaitFor karma_decay_coherent 3
# replay-gate: karma_decay_matches_oracle
nf.Expect own_pk == 1
# Total budget >= sum of the derived per-step timeouts plus30s exit grace.
nf.Within 240
